        ex:hasText "Another relevant reference is our company's work with a national professional order, where our company's developed a regulatory-information assistant for a national professional order members, showcasing our company's capacity to handle large volumes of regulatory and methodological reference materials. our company's consortium partners include OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, which can help ensure data sovereignty and compliance with regulations such as GDPR. our company's also partner with Ligeo Conseil, an integration partner that can assist in connecting our company's Atelier platform to cabinet vauclair associ s' production tools, ensuring a seamless integration into cabinet vauclair associ s' existing practices." ;
