        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds for common queries (con:con55), high availability during business hours (con:con56), integration with cabinet vauclair associ s production tools, accounting production software, payroll software, document management ged (con:con60), and electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment (con:con61), as well as user directory SSO (con:con62) and API-type interfaces (con:con63)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current technology stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows: Response times below 2 seconds for common queries (con:con55): FULLY COVERED our platform Atelier has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency below 2.5 seconds, which meets The client requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Quick access to reliable, up-to-date information drawn from accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine and the tax code (CGI), the commercial code and applicable legal texts, collective-bargaining agreements for payroll/social, and Cabinet Vauclair & Associés internal procedures and methodology guides." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "High availability during business hours (con:con56): FULLY COVERED Our platform Atelier is designed for high availability during business hours, with active-active redundancy across two availability zones, ensuring that Our platform Atelier remains operational even in the event of component failures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with cabinet vauclair associ s production tools, accounting production software, payroll software, document management ged (con:con60): PARTIALLY COVERED our architecture_and_integration_capabilities include connectors and adapters for accounting-production and payroll software, as well as document-management systems (GED), which can be used to integrate with the client's production tools." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, specific integration with cabinet vauclair associ s production tools would require additional customization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment (con:con61): PARTIALLY COVERED our have experience with integrating with electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environments, but a specific integration with the client's environment may require additional development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "User directory SSO (con:con62): FULLY COVERED our identity management capabilities include support for SSO using SAML and OIDC, as well as user directories such as LDAP and Entra ID, which can be used to integrate with the client's user directory." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API-type interfaces (con:con63): FULLY COVERED Our platform Atelier is designed with an API-first approach, providing REST and webhook APIs that are fully documented, allowing for easy integration with other systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed architecture: To meet the client's requirements, our propose deploying Our platform Atelier on our Sovereign tier hosting option, which provides SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure and EU-only data storage. deploying will ensure high availability, security, and compliance with regulatory requirements. our will also work with the client to customize the integration with the client production tools and electronic invoicing dematerialisation environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our will provide API documentation and support for user directory SSO integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict confidentiality obligations (req:req7), professional secrecy and reliability of figures (req:req11), GDPR compliance for personal data protection (con:con36, con:con37), encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant (con:con40), and data hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent (con:con64)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks that can ensure compliance with these requirements? the company's, holds ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the scope of Development, delivery, and operations. the company's also have ISO 27701 certification, which is a privacy information management extension." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

